# Platinum Angel: "your opponents can't win the game" (CR 104.2b). Bot2's library is down to two cards when its Thassa's
# Oracle enters on turn 4: its devotion to blue, 2, is at least the cards in its library, so the Oracle says Bot2 wins the
# game - and with Bot1's Angel out, Bot2 can't, so nothing happens and the game goes on (the 2009-10-01 ruling). Bot2's
# draw on turn 6 then leaves one card.

